{
  "info": {
    "name": "Tasks REST API - Assignment 6",
    "description": "Demonstrates every route of the Tasks API, including error cases. Start the server (npm start), then run the requests in order: \"Create task\" stores the new id in the \"taskId\" variable used by the later requests.",
